# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit 1.0 brings new stability guarantees and performance improvements, but it\n"
"does break compatibility with all previous versions of Qiskit. See the\n"
"following guides on updating your environment and code to work with Qiskit v1.0.\n"
msgstr ""
"Qiskit 1.0 hadir dengan jaminan stabilitas baru dan peningkatan performa, "
"tapi sayangnya memutus kompatibilitas dengan semua versi Qiskit sebelumnya. "
"Lihat panduan-panduan berikut untuk memperbarui environment dan kode kamu "
"agar bisa bekerja dengan Qiskit v1.0.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Install the new Qiskit v1.0 package](/guides/qiskit-1.0-installation) for "
"upgrading Python environments and project dependencies.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Instal paket Qiskit v1.0 yang baru](/guides/qiskit-1.0-installation) untuk "
"upgrade environment Python dan dependensi proyek.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Qiskit v1.0 feature changes](/guides/qiskit-1.0-features) for updating your"
" code.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Perubahan fitur Qiskit v1.0](/guides/qiskit-1.0-features) untuk memperbarui"
" kode kamu.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"[Breaking package changes of Qiskit v1.0](/guides/metapackage-migration) to "
"understand the new and old package structure.\n"
msgstr ""
"[Perubahan paket yang memutus kompatibilitas di Qiskit "
"v1.0](/guides/metapackage-migration) untuk memahami struktur paket baru dan "
"lama.\n"

# doq-bootstrap: positional
#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Read more about the benefits of Qiskit v1.0 on the [IBM&reg; "
"blog](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-1-0-release-summary).\n"
msgstr ""
"Baca lebih lanjut tentang manfaat Qiskit v1.0 di [blog "
"IBM&reg;](https://www.ibm.com/quantum/blog/qiskit-1-0-release-summary).\n"
